      "source": "Pinned Immersive Engineering 12.4.2-194 JAR",
      "url": "https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering/files/6733669",
      "details": "Native coke brick, blast brick, hammer, wire coil and alloy brick recipes do not require Industrial Chassis. The pack chassis recipe consumes steel plates, creosote-treated wood, copper wire coils and an iron component."
    },
    {
      "source": "SOQM custom recipes",
      "path": "overrides/kubejs/server_scripts/qm_expert_progression.js",
      "details": "kubejs:expert/kubejs/industrial_chassis: 4 steel plates + 2 treated wood + 2 copper coils + 1 iron component → 2 chassis. The complete preparation line must be available before its own output."
    },
    {
      "source": "Pinned native recipes and custom engineering-block recipes",
      "path": "overrides/kubejs/server_scripts/qm_expert_v042.js",
      "details": "Native redstone engineering, fluid pipes, conveyors and reinforced blast bricks do not use Precision Mechanism. Custom light/heavy engineering blocks use Industrial Chassis and Electromechanical Drive; the drive itself uses iron plates, copper coils, steel rods and a piston. Basic IE production therefore does not require the later AE2/Mekanism precision milestone."
    }
  ],
  "chapters": {
    "qm_v030_03_immersive": {
      "summary": {
        "uk_ua": "Почни з молота й коксової печі. Кокс веде до сталі, крезот — до оброблених дощок; разом із дротом і компонентом вони дають перше шасі. Далі обери воду або вітер для живлення, підготуй логістику й збирай потрібні виробничі машини.",
        "en_us": "Start with a hammer and Coke Oven. Coke leads to steel, creosote to treated planks; combine them with wire and a component for the first chassis. Then choose water or wind power, prepare transport and build the production machines you need."
      },
